### Inside the band: level to level

Each row of Levels 2 and 3 assumes the level before's row in its thread (one level back), so it opens as a
retrieval task, in the review unit and again inside day 2 of its unit. Band course days: Level 1 is days 1 to 160,
Level 2 days 161 to 320, Level 3 days 321 to 480, Level 4 days 481 to 640.

